include docs/architecture/03-setup-and-retrieval.md
include docs/architecture/04-grading-architectures.md
include docs/architecture/05-final-agent-procedures.md
include docs/architecture/06-evaluation.md
include docs/configuration.md
include docs/datasets.md
include docs/extensions.md
include docs/models.md
include docs/packaging.md
include docs/playground.md
